WEBVTT

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:28.610
GREEN DOLPHIN STREET STATE PRISON

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:38.410
Stop right there!

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:39.700
What's going on here?

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:41.660
What are you doing?

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:46.500
ULTRA SECURITY HOUSE UNIT

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:49.590
Prisoner FE40536.

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:51.960
Name, Jolyne Cujoh.

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:55.380
This is the second time
you've caused us trouble.

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:57.180
First, you attempted a jailbreak.

00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:00.600
And now, at the prison mausoleum,

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:04.480
a female inmate has been found dead
from blunt force head trauma.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:08.650
And yet, you refuse to talk
and continue to act defiantly.

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:10.770
For some reason,

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:14.650
violence and death follow you
wherever you go.

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:16.950
We have no proof that you're the culprit,

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:19.910
but you are, without a doubt,
the troublesome type.

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:25.210
Therefore, from now on,

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:27.580
you will be disciplined
according to protocol.

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:31.000
You are hereby confined

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:35.010
for an indefinite amount of time
in this Ultra Security House Unit.

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:05.160
Fuck!

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:08.500
-Fuck!
-There's a woman!

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:13.340
The newcomer's a woman!

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:16.460
I smell a woman!

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:20.140
Her smell is seeping out under the door!

00:02:23.430 --> 00:02:24.680
What the hell?

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:27.100
Yes!

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:30.190
I got shit on her face!

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:34.570
My own shit, on a woman's face!

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:37.990
I want to bash her up too!

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:43.830
One thing that must not happen here
is the exhaustion of my mental strength.

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:48.200
The unnecessary stress
and the physical toll it takes.

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:55.460
There is something I must accomplish
in this Ultra Security House Unit!

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:00.470
I must succeed, no matter what.

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:05.310
And for that, I must not waste any energy.

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:08.350
No.

00:03:08.850 --> 00:03:10.980
I will grow even stronger!

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:22.490
It may be possible to attain heaven.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:24.450
23 YEARS AGO

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:27.160
Hey, don't look so glum.

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.410
I'm not talking about death.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.290
The heaven I'm talking about

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:34.420
has to do with the soul.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.790
The place our soul travels to.

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:39.800
The power of our soul
must surely evolve there.

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.760
I'm talking about
the final form of our souls.

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:46.930
Surely, you, out of anyone else
are able to comprehend.

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:50.520
True happiness lies there.

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:53.190
But this is contingent upon
attaining heaven.

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:55.020
I know happiness is not attained

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:57.860
by obtaining the mightiest body,
having lots of money,

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:02.150
or having dominion over others.

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:04.780
True victory

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:06.950
belongs to those who have seen heaven.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:11.080
I will do everything…

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:15.630
…to reach that end.

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:52.810
Let's say I place
this sticker on this pen.

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:53.890
EPISODE 13: SMACK OF LOVE AND REVENGE (1)

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:57.020
It then creates a copy of the pen.

00:05:58.020 --> 00:05:59.480
This is my ability.

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:02.020
I call it Smack.

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:03.320
Peel the sticker off, and…

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:08.070
the pen fuses back together
with force, leaving a fissure.

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:09.820
It is now easier to destroy.

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:15.040
I take this ability as my sign from God.

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:24.420
He'll remember in no time

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:28.720
that this seal of kiss
is my license for revenge.

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:32.510
Good morning, Father.

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:36.560
May I have one of these flowers?

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:39.270
I've grown a fondness for them recently.

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:41.480
Of course, feel free to take it.

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:43.690
Sports Maximum.

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:57.370
F.F., she's cutting in front of you.

00:06:58.370 --> 00:07:00.790
Hey, I said she cut in line.

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:01.920
I know.

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:03.920
For some reason,

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:07.170
I feel like the others
don't accept me here.

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:09.260
It's like they're looking down on me.

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:11.760
Don't cut, dumbass!

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:12.930
Tell her off.

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:15.010
I disagree with you.

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:17.390
It's not good to force something.

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:21.230
You have to change yourself
before seeking approval from others.

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:22.150
Isn't that right?

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:26.570
So, I decided to do the exact opposite
of what I usually do.

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:29.570
What's the opposite of coffee?

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:30.610
Tea?

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:35.200
That's right. Atroe's body,
which I took over, is craving coffee.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:36.780
So I go with tea instead.

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:38.200
On purpose.

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:43.250
Does that make sense?

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:48.340
Instead of bread, I eat rice.

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:52.220
Use my non-dominant left hand
instead of my right hand to eat.

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:55.760
I'm trying to change myself
by doing the exact opposite.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:57.600
Listen, F.F.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:00.140
The wound where I got shot…

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:02.850
It hurts like hell.

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:04.190
I told you.

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:06.810
I can only fill the holes with plankton.

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:09.570
The rest is up to
your body's ability to heal.

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:11.190
-Got that?
-Damn.

00:08:12.610 --> 00:08:15.410
Jolyne, what's the opposite of pork?

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:17.160
Maybe chicken, or even beef.

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:19.660
The opposite of pork is salmon.

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:21.790
Pigs lie around in mud all day.

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:24.670
Salmons swim against the current
to go upstream.

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:26.630
I love that.

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:28.880
They're cutting again.

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:31.590
Scram, bitch! Come on, tell them off!

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:34.340
Like I said, I'm trying
the exact opposite.

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:36.680
Like dragging people into the line.

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:38.680
Come along now, right here.

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:40.350
What's the matter with you?

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:42.350
I won't let you cut in front of me.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:43.850
Don't touch me, bitch.

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:45.940
Go to the back, dumbass!

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:48.110
What did you call me, bitch?

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:50.230
-The hell?
-Look at that.

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:52.650
It's so much easier to grab food now.
Easy as pie.

00:08:56.610 --> 00:08:59.410
By the way, where's Ermes?

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:01.950
I haven't seen her for a few days.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:04.040
Haven't you heard?

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:08.880
She's following a man?

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:10.420
Is Ermes really doing that?

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:13.210
Yeah. Every morning for a while now.

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:17.090
Even when you got shot, Jolyne.

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:23.140
I haven't seen Jolyne.

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:25.180
Something's going on in the courtyard.
Looks bad.

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:30.610
Hey, Ermes!

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:34.490
Leave her be.

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:40.240
The inmate Ermes is tailing?

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:43.200
Yes. You know all the rumors around here.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:44.580
That's correct.

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:47.040
I'm honored you came to me, Jolyne.

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:52.460
Oh, you don't expect me
to tell you for free, right?

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:54.760
An information fee.

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:57.170
I'll give you a friend's discount.

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:06.310
Found it.

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:12.110
"The body of a female thought to have been
caught in the crossfire of gang violence

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:14.280
was found by the river before dawn."

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:15.900
Florida's local papers.

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:17.570
It's dated six years ago.

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:20.110
It's exactly as Gwess said.

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:23.830
Gloria Costello.

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:26.540
So she is Ermes's older sister.

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:29.960
THE NEXT DAY

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:33.840
Over the last few days,

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:35.460
I've waited for the right time

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:37.840
as I watched you, carefully and closely.

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:41.220
I don't know what caused you
to change your heart,

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:44.890
but I watched you sweeping
the old prison's graveyard.

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:47.180
You also left flowers at a grave.

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:49.640
Were they for your fellow gang members

00:10:49.730 --> 00:10:51.560
who were executed in the electric chair?

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:55.070
I also watched you

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:58.690
making taxidermy birds and alligators
in the prison's workshop.

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:03.740
Now, why would a grunt like you take up
a sudden interest in such a hobby?

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:06.620
Well, none of that matters.

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:11.120
But there's one thing I must know.

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:16.050
Jolyne, F.F.

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:18.260
You seem well, Ermes.

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:21.300
Here you go. Your share of breakfast.

00:11:24.430 --> 00:11:25.550
Ermes,

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:27.720
about that man you are following…

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:30.060
Following? I don't know what you mean.

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:31.810
Don't play stupid.

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:34.770
His name is Sports Maximum.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:37.020
He is a notorious gangster
in the outside world.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:39.400
But now, he is incarcerated
in the male wing here.

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:42.780
Is that so? Not that it concerns me.

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:43.820
Ermes.

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:49.080
You were sent here at Green Dolphin
for armed robbery.

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:54.540
Did you do that just to become
a convict at this facility?

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:59.170
For you to exact revenge on Sports Maximum
for your sister's death.

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:00.670
Jolyne.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:03.130
You don't pry into
other people's business in prison.

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:04.430
Really?

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:07.510
Well, I'm doing opposites today.

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:12.230
I don't need you to butt in.

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:13.770
Go back to the female wing.

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:18.940
Ermes is right, Jolyne.

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:21.190
You have your own mission to worry about.

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:23.400
I know.

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:27.030
Just a little longer, Gloria.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:31.040
I'll avenge you with my own hands.

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:36.880
Ermes.

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:40.550
Think of me as your mother from now on.

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:47.550
From that day on,

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:49.510
Gloria…

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:53.890
you always put the family first.

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:56.480
Ermes.

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:59.190
You can help at the store
sometimes, you know.

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:04.360
I want you to inherit
your father's restaurant with me.

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:07.240
The hell should I care.
I'm getting out of here.

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:10.830
I want to get a cross-country scholarship
and go to college.

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:13.870
Don't act all high and mighty
and tell me what to do.

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:15.040
Ermes!

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:17.790
Don't leave!

00:13:31.350 --> 00:13:33.140
Help me…

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:37.940
Fetch me that thick stick with your mouth.

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:42.320
Not like a dog, but as a baby would do it.

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:02.170
I'm not interested in seeing
what lies in the dark.

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:04.550
I wouldn't report it
to the authorities either.

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:08.880
The darkness will handle
those who live by it.

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:14.600
That's the only way to keep
a restaurant open in that city.

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:16.270
But that night…

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:32.320
Gloria had no choice but to put herself
in danger and call the police.

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.240
She did it to protect me.

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:35.870
But even then…

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.170
Defendant Sports Maximum,

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:42.420
you are hereby sentenced
to five years in prison

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:43.630
for tax evasion and assault.

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:47.340
Five years? Only five years?

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:51.970
We can't corner him with a weak witness.

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:54.350
This is the best we can do.

00:14:54.430 --> 00:14:56.560
He had her killed!

00:14:56.640 --> 00:14:58.390
He destroyed all evidence of that.

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:02.440
Bullshit.

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:04.270
-Wait. Wait, dammit!
-Stay put!

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:10.070
Fucking bastard!

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.550
So you do remember her.

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:31.180
That's right.

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:34.180
You must not forget Gloria.

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:39.520
Gloria!

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:50.900
I've been waiting for this chance.

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:56.030
I've been waiting for you to be alone
so no one can hear your screams.

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:59.240
That's what I've been wanting to know.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:02.500
The things you made Gloria suffer through.

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:04.830
Sports Maximum.

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:08.250
I'll make you remember them!

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:14.890
STAND NAME: SMACK
STAND MASTER: ERMES COSTELLO

00:16:18.470 --> 00:16:19.970
The hell is this?

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:22.140
What are you doing to me, bitch?

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:25.270
Your sentence ends in about a year.

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:27.820
Once you're free, you'll have bodyguards.

00:16:28.730 --> 00:16:30.780
But you are defenseless in here!

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:35.700
Yes. It's a perfect fit for you.

00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:40.580
It's true that prison pipes are not
big enough to fit a human being.

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:44.670
But that means
it fits you perfectly as a coffin.

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:48.380
Is that the sound of you falling down?

00:16:48.460 --> 00:16:49.920
Hey, help me out.

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.460
Who the hell are you?

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:53.630
Let me out, now!

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:57.850
-You still don't understand who I am?
-What?

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:00.850
Take the last few moments of your life
to think it through.

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:03.810
You left Gloria's body in the gutter.

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:07.650
And her suffering drove my father ill.

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:09.610
I…

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:11.150
lost everything.

00:17:12.570 --> 00:17:15.820
Beg them for forgiveness in hell,
Sports Maximum!

00:17:16.320 --> 00:17:19.830
If you can with that mouth
full of wastewater, that is!

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:26.920
I placed a second sticker on the pipe.

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:30.250
It'll be a lid for this coffin.

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:34.880
It's completely closed now.

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:37.930
Now, scream all you want.

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:40.800
-You bitch!
-Go on, call for help.

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:45.140
Only cockroaches and rats will hear you.

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:50.400
You belong in the gutter, bastard.

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:53.530
Now try to scream, Sports Maximum!

00:17:55.190 --> 00:18:01.990
Those who rise from the darkness,
Limp Viscuit… Come forth and join me…

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:09.250
We will share joy
in the darkness, Limp Viscuit…

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:29.270
Something's there.

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:32.310
It's coming towards me.

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:40.360
This attack!

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:41.320
It can't be!

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:42.780
Sports Maximum can't be…

00:18:56.380 --> 00:18:58.050
Fuck, my finger.

00:18:59.590 --> 00:19:00.930
He's using a Stand ability.

00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:03.680
I don't understand why I can't see it,

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:06.100
but I definitely felt its form.

00:19:06.600 --> 00:19:07.980
It was bird-shaped!

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:16.150
Sticker…

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:31.830
Did I win? Did I crush it?

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:36.300
I couldn't have known that
he gained a Stand ability.

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:37.460
How's that?

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:41.220
Sports Maximum, you've gone quiet.

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:44.140
Did you get crushed inside that pipe?

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:48.470
Or did the filthy water fill you up
from your mouth to your asshole,

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:51.020
drowning you to death?

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:18.460
What is it now?

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:24.340
Is Sports Maximum still alive?

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:27.720
He must still be alive in that pipe,

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:29.890
hence this strange unseen power.

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:40.230
It's bigger than the last one.

00:20:44.240 --> 00:20:45.110
It's fast!

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:53.290
This power…

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:56.790
Could it be the stuffed alligator
from the workshop?

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:58.710
Earlier, that was…

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:02.340
the bird's corpse moving around.

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:04.760
The invisible corpses
have gained the power to move.

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:07.220
They're the ones attacking me!

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:09.970
That bastard.

00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:12.270
He's trying to bust the pipe
and break free!

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:13.680
Ermes.

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:16.310
Why are you up there?

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:17.810
Ermes.

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:19.440
Jolyne is worried about you--

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:22.860
Jolyne, F.F, don't come any closer!

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:33.450
-F.F!
-There's an enemy.

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:34.540
There's an alligator.

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:38.170
Invisible, dead beasts
are crawling around!

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:47.800
Damn, it got my leg.

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:50.720
Ermes, just what is happening here?

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:53.560
-Is this a Stand attack?
-That's right.

00:21:53.640 --> 00:21:55.390
It's that bastard, Sports Maximum.

00:21:55.480 --> 00:21:58.850
He gained a Stand ability
without me knowing…

00:22:01.360 --> 00:22:03.730
Run! It's charging towards you!

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:06.490
It's already on the move!

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:07.860
Stone Ocean!

00:23:41.330 --> 00:23:46.340
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
